  "title": "Your Amenities Might Be Costing You Renewals",
  "summary": "When was the last time you looked at your amenity package through the eyes of your residents?For years, multifamily communities have competed by adding more. Larger fitness centers, coworking lounges, dog parks, package lockers, rooftop spaces, coffee bars, and smart home technology. Amenities have become a major selling point, and in many markets, they're expected.But here's the question more operators should be asking: Are your amenities actually driving renewals, or quietly driving residents",
